endra patrols Shen'dar Highlands. Turn in to learn Bear Form."}, [218]={hint="Find and kill Ur'endra in the Shen'dar Highlands.", desc="Ur'endra patrols Shen'dar Highlands. Turn in to learn Bear Form."}, [219]={npc="Urs'endris", tgt="Urs'endris", desc="Ur'endra patrols Shen'dar Highlands. Turn in to learn Bear Form."}, [220]={text="Return to the Valanaar inn (62.20, 72.60); if you're not level 12 yet, grind nearby to 12 before taking the boat to Dalaran."}, [221]={npc="Anathamaas Aetherwind", tgt="Anathamaas Aetherwind", desc="Do it before you sail away from Zephras Isle."}, [222]={npc="Belann Windwood", tgt="Belann Windwood", desc="Do it before you sail away from Zephras Isle."}, [223]={npc="Belann Windwood", tgt="Belann Windwood", desc="Do it before you sail away from Zephras Isle."}, [224]={hint="Bring a Wind-Infused Bough to Belann Windwood in Valanaar.", desc="Do it before you sail away from Zephras Isle."}, [225]={npc="Belann Windwood", tgt="Belann Windwood", desc="Do it before you sail away from Zephras Isle."}, [226]={text="Return to the Valanaar inn (62.20, 72.60); if you're not level 12 yet, grind nearby to 12 before taking the boat to Dalaran."}, [227]={desc="If you're not level 12 yet, kill Vuldren Alphas west of Valanaar (level 10, around 57.5, 71.7) until 12, then take the boat."}, [228]={to="Dalaran", from="Zephras Isle"}, [229]={npc="Denaaris Stargale", tgt="Denaaris Stargale"}, [230]={npc="Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver", tgt="Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver", desc="Accept it when you arrive in Dalaran. If you missed it, go straight to Sheldras Moontree in Stormwind and accept Moonglade."}, [232]={npc="Denaaris Stargale", tgt="Denaaris Stargale"}, [233]={hint="Take the Skyborne Portal to Stormwind and report to Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep."}, [234]={npc="Highlord Bolvar Fordragon", tgt="Highlord Bolvar Fordragon"}, [235]={node="Stormwind"}, [236]={text="Set your hearth in the Stormwind inn (60.50, 75.20).", bind="Stormwind"}, [237]={text="Shiny Bauble"}, [238]={text="Nightcrawlers"}, [239]={npc="Gilbert Gray", tgt="Gilbert Gray"}, [240]={npc="Gilbert Gray", tgt="Gilbert Gray"}, [241]={npc="Sheldras Moontree", tgt="Sheldras Moontree", desc="Accept it when you arrive in Dalaran. If you missed it, go straight to Sheldras Moontree in Stormwind and accept Moonglade."}, [242]={npc="Sheldras Moontree", tgt="Sheldras Moontree", desc="Learn Teleport: Moonglade in Stormwind, then teleport there to turn in."}, [243]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Learn Teleport: Moonglade in Stormwind, then teleport there to turn in."}, [244]={bind="Stormwind", desc="Return to Stormwind Harbor and take the boat to Auberdine. If your Hearthstone is on cooldown, see Silva Fil'naveth in Nighthaven (44.15, 45.23) for the druid-only flight to Rut'theran Village, then take the boat to Auberdine from the dock."}, [245]={to="Auberdine", from="Stormwind", desc="Board at the pier in Stormwind Harbor."}}},
    ["01-9"] = {tips={{k="交通", text="From Stormwind, take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge. If you left Teldrassil early, sail from Auberdine to Stormwind first, then take the tram."}}, steps={[1]={npc="Rudra Amberstill", tgt="Rudra Amberstill", tag="Optional, Group"}, [2]={hint="Rudra Amberstill wants you to slay Vagash and bring his fang to her at the Ram ranch.", tag="Optional, Group"}, [3]={npc="Rudra Amberstill", tgt="Rudra Amberstill", tag="Optional, Group"}, [4]={npc="Earthseer Farsen", tgt="Earthseer Farsen"}, [5]={npc="Earthseer Farsen", tgt="Earthseer Farsen"}, [6]={npc="Earthseer Farsen", tgt="Earthseer Farsen"}, [7]={npc="Senator Mehr Stonehallow", tgt="Senator Mehr Stonehallow"}, [8]={npc="Foreman Stonebrow", tgt="Foreman Stonebrow"}, [9]={hint="Slay 10 Dark Iron Spies in Dun Morogh."}, [10]={npc="Dark Iron Map", npcObj=true, tag="If it drops, Optional", desc="Right-click Dark Iron Map in your bags to start the quest."}, [11]={hint="Kill 6 Rockjaw Skullthumpers for Foreman Stonebrow at the Gol'Bolar quarry."}, [12]={hint="Kill 10 Rockjaw Bonesnappers for Senator Mehr Stonehallow at the Gol'Bolar quarry."}, [13]={npc="Foreman Stonebrow", tgt="Foreman Stonebrow"}, [14]={npc="Senator Mehr Stonehallow", tgt="Senator Mehr Stonehallow"}, [15]={npc="Earthseer Farsen", tgt="Earthseer Farsen"}, [16]={npc="Earthseer Farsen", tgt="Earthseer Farsen"}, [17]={npc="Pilot Hammerfoot", tgt="Pilot Hammerfoot"}, [18]={npc="A Dwarven Corpse", npcObj=true}, [19]={npc="A Dwarven Corpse", npcObj=true}, [20]={hint="Kill Mangeclaw."}, [21]={npc="Pilot Hammerfoot", tgt="Pilot Hammerfoot"}, [22]={text="Climb over the mountain: instead of the North Gate tunnel, head east up the slope from here and follow the arrow along the ridge to the other side (79.40, 49.90 → 80.40, 49.70 → 81.50, 50.10 → 83.10, 49.50), then drop to the ledge in front first, then down to the ground, and walk to Loch Modan's southern guard tower."}, [23]={npc="Mountaineer Cobbleflint", tgt="Mountaineer Cobbleflint", desc="Carefully drop down to the ledge ahead, then down to the ground."}, [24]={npc="Captain Rugelfuss", tgt="Captain Rugelfuss"}, [25]={node="Thelsamar"}, [26]={to="Ironforge", desc="If Ironforge isn't on your flight map, head west through the pass back to Dun Morogh and walk straight to Kharanos."}, [27]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [28]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Large Crag Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Grif Wildheart in Kharanos."}, [29]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [30]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [31]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Snow Leopard. Practice your skills, then return to Grif Wildheart in Kharanos."}, [32]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [33]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [34]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame an Ice Claw Bear. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Grif Wildheart in Kharanos."}, [35]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [36]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [37]={npc="Granis Swiftaxe", tgt="Granis Swiftaxe", tag="Optional", desc="The intro quest is optional: go straight to Muren Stormpike in Ironforge and accept Vejrek."}, [38]={npc="Muren Stormpike", tgt="Muren Stormpike", tag="Optional", desc="The intro quest is optional: go straight to Muren Stormpike in Ironforge and accept Vejrek."}, [39]={npc="Muren Stormpike", tgt="Muren Stormpike", desc="Vejrek is near the ice cave in southwestern Dun Morogh."}, [40]={hint="Bring Vejrek's Head to Muren Stormpike in Ironforge.", desc="Vejrek is near the ice cave in southwestern Dun Morogh."}, [41]={npc="Muren Stormpike", tgt="Muren Stormpike", desc="Vejrek is near the ice cave in southwestern Dun Morogh."}, [42]={npc="Muren Stormpike", tgt="Muren Stormpike"}, [43]={npc="Tormus Deepforge", tgt="Tormus Deepforge"}, [44]={npc="Tormus Deepforge", tgt="Tormus Deepforge"}, [45]={hint="Bring a load of Umbral Ore to Tormus Deepforge in Ironforge."}, [46]={npc="Tormus Deepforge", tgt="Tormus Deepforge"}, [47]={npc="Tormus Deepforge", tgt="Tormus Deepforge"}, [48]={npc="Tormus Deepforge", tgt="Tormus Deepforge"}, [49]={npc="Ingrid Dunwald", tgt="Ingrid Dunwald", desc="Accept it in Kharanos, then find Bruegs Kindleborn at the pass from eastern Dun Morogh to Loch Modan."}, [50]={npc="Bruegs Kindleborn", tgt="Bruegs Kindleborn", desc="Accept it in Kharanos, then find Bruegs Kindleborn at the pass from eastern Dun Morogh to Loch Modan."}, [51]={npc="Bruegs Kindleborn", tgt="Bruegs Kindleborn"}, [52]={npc="Braldir Ashmantle", tgt="Braldir Ashmantle"}, [53]={npc="Braldir Ashmantle", tgt="Braldir Ashmantle"}, [54]={hint="Bring 1 Fire Tar and 1 Reagent Pouch to Braldir Ashmantle in Loch Modan."}, [55]={npc="Braldir Ashmantle", tgt="Braldir Ashmantle"}, [56]={npc="Braldir Ashmantle", tgt="Braldir Ashmantle"}, [57]={npc="Braldir Ashmantle", tgt="Braldir Ashmantle"}, [58]={npc="Braldir Ashmantle", tgt="Braldir Ashmantle"}, [59]={hint="Defeat the Minor Manifestation of Fire, and place the Glowing Ember in the brazier atop the Shrine of Eternal Flame."}, [60]={npc="Brazier of the Dormant Flame", npcObj=true}, [61]={npc="Brazier of the Dormant Flame", npcObj=true}, [62]={npc="Bruegs Kindleborn", tgt="Bruegs Kindleborn"}, [63]={npc="Hogral Bakkan", tgt="Hogral Bakkan", desc="You can only accept Simple Subterfugin' after turning in this breadcrumb."}, [64]={npc="Hulfdan Blackbeard", tgt="Hulfdan Blackbeard", desc="You can only accept Simple Subterfugin' after turning in this breadcrumb."}, [65]={npc="Hulfdan Blackbeard", tgt="Hulfdan Blackbeard"}, [66]={npc="Onin MacHammar", tgt="Onin MacHammar"}, [67]={npc="Onin MacHammar", tgt="Onin MacHammar"}, [68]={npc="Hulfdan Blackbeard", tgt="Hulfdan Blackbeard"}, [69]={npc="Magis Sparkmantle", tgt="Magis Sparkmantle", tag="Optional", desc="The intro quest is optional: go straight to Bink in Ironforge and accept Mage-tastic Gizmonitor."}, [70]={npc="Bink", tgt="Bink", tag="Optional", desc="The intro quest is optional: go straight to Bink in Ironforge and accept Mage-tastic Gizmonitor."}, [71]={npc="Bink", tgt="Bink"}, [72]={hint="Bring Bink her Mage-tastic Gizmonitor."}, [73]={npc="Bink", tgt="Bink"}, [74]={npc="High Priestess Mims", tgt="High Priestess Mims"}, [75]={npc="High Priestess Mims", tgt="High Priestess Mims"}, [76]={text="Hunters: tame any pet you like. A boar is recommended (Charge pulls fast)."}, [77]={npc="Belia Thundergranite", tgt="Belia Thundergranite"}, [78]={to="Thelsamar"}, [79]={hint="Mountaineer Cobbleflint of the southern guard tower wants you to kill 10 Stonesplinter Troggs and 10 Stonesplinter Scouts."}, [80]={hint="Bring 8 Trogg Stone Teeth to Captain Rugelfuss in the southern guard tower."}, [81]={npc="Mountaineer Cobbleflint", tgt="Mountaineer Cobbleflint"}, [82]={npc="Mountaineer Gravelgaw", tgt="Mountaineer Gravelgaw"}, [83]={npc="Captain Rugelfuss", tgt="Captain Rugelfuss"}, [84]={node="Thelsamar"}, [85]={text="Set your hearth in the Thelsamar inn (35.40, 48.40).", bind="Thelsamar"}, [86]={npc="Brock Stoneseeker", tgt="Brock Stoneseeker"}, [87]={npc="Mountaineer Kadrell", tgt="Mountaineer Kadrell", desc="Mountaineer Kadrell walks back and forth along the Thelsamar road (32.6, 49.7 to 36.8, 42.0). If he isn't here, follow the road."}, [88]={npc="Mountaineer Kadrell", tgt="Mountaineer Kadrell", desc="Mountaineer Kadrell walks back and forth along the Thelsamar road (32.6, 49.7 to 36.8, 42.0). If he isn't here, follow the road."}, [89]={npc="Mountaineer Stormpike", tgt="Mountaineer Stormpike"}, [90]={npc="Mountaineer Stormpike", tgt="Mountaineer Stormpike"}, [91]={npc="Mountaineer Stormpike", tgt="Mountaineer Stormpike"}, [92]={npc="Mountaineer Stormpike", tgt="Mountaineer Stormpike"}, [93]={hint="Go to the Silver Stream Mine and collect 4 loads of Miners' Gear."}, [94]={hint="Bring 12 Tunnel Rat Ears to Mountaineer Kadrell in Thelsamar."}, [95]={text="Heavy Spiked Mace", npc="Nillen Andemar", tag="Optional", d