 letter from Klaven's Tower in Westfall. Afterwards, learn Poisons."}, [95]={npc="An Unsent Letter", npcObj=true, tag="If it drops", desc="Dropped by VanCleef in the Deadmines: right-click it to accept the quest."}, [96]={bind="Stormwind"}, [97]={npc="Master Mathias Shaw", tgt="Master Mathias Shaw", desc="Steal the sealed letter from Klaven's Tower in Westfall. Afterwards, learn Poisons."}, [98]={npc="Master Mathias Shaw", tgt="Master Mathias Shaw", tag="Optional"}, [99]={npc="Doc Mixilpixil", tgt="Doc Mixilpixil", tag="Optional"}, [100]={npc="Doc Mixilpixil", tgt="Doc Mixilpixil", tag="Optional"}, [101]={npc="Doc Mixilpixil", tgt="Doc Mixilpixil", tag="Optional"}, [102]={npc="Doc Mixilpixil", tgt="Doc Mixilpixil", tag="Optional", desc="Vendors sell Simple Wildflowers and Leaded Vial. Bronze Tube can be bought at the Auction House. Pick up the Spool of Light Chartreuse Silk Thread inside the tailoring shop in Stormwind's Canals."}, [103]={hint="Bring Doc Mixilpixil one bundle of Simple Wildflowers, one Leaded Vial, one Bronze Tube, and one Spool of Light Chartreuse Silk Thread. The 'itis' doesn't cure itself, young fella/lady.", tag="Optional"}, [104]={npc="Doc Mixilpixil", tgt="Doc Mixilpixil", tag="Optional"}, [106]={text="Bronze Tube", npc="Billibub Cogspinner", desc="Limited stock. Buy only if it's available."}, [107]={npc="Sprite Jumpsprocket", tgt="Sprite Jumpsprocket"}, [108]={npc="Baros Alexston", tgt="Baros Alexston"}, [109]={npc="Baros Alexston", tgt="Baros Alexston"}, [110]={npc="Warden Thelwater", tgt="Warden Thelwater"}, [111]={npc="Duthorian Rall", tgt="Duthorian Rall"}, [112]={npc="Duthorian Rall", tgt="Duthorian Rall"}, [113]={npc="Tome of Valor", npcObj=true, desc="Right-click Tome of Valor in your bags to start the quest."}, [114]={npc="Duthorian Rall", tgt="Duthorian Rall", desc="Right-click Tome of Valor in your bags to start the quest."}, [115]={npc="Duthorian Rall", tgt="Duthorian Rall"}, [116]={npc="Daphne Stilwell", tgt="Daphne Stilwell"}, [1